𒑰 DUB.SAR 1.0 Example: Reciprocal Table Lookup
𒑰 Difficulty: Mastery
𒑰 Concept: Archival Reference Tables & Reciprocals
𒑰 Mode: Tablet (Canonical Cuneiform)
𒑰
𒑰 Purpose:
𒑰   Consults the standard immutable reference tablet 'reciprocals'
𒑰   from the tablet archive and executes exact sexagesimal division.
𒑰
𒑰 Expected Output:
𒑰   0;7,30
𒑰   3;45

𒂊𒁹
    𒅆 𒁾 "reciprocals" 𒁶 𒅎

    𒈦 :
        𒅎 8 𒋗

    𒊕 : 30
    𒁇 :
        𒊕
        𒈦
        𒊭

𒅗𒁹
